## Overview

RecruitIQ is a full-stack AI recruitment platform that helps organizations move from résumé overload to clear, evidence-based hiring. Employers post roles, review applicants, and receive ranked shortlists powered by real language-model analysis — while candidates apply through a dedicated portal with transparent progress at every stage.

---

## What RecruitIQ Does

RecruitIQ connects three audiences — **employers**, **applicants**, and **platform administrators** — in a single cohesive workflow. Jobs are defined with structured requirements: skills, experience, education, and certifications. Applicants submit cover letters and supporting documents; the system extracts readable content from PDFs and Word files, then evaluates each application against the role using Ollama-hosted models for scoring, narrative summaries, and hire/no-hire recommendations.

The result is not a generic filter. Each candidate receives an individual assessment: overall match percentage, skill alignment, experience and education fit, documented strengths, identified gaps, and a ranked position relative to peers for the same opening.

