## AI Analysis

RecruitIQ’s analysis layer is **Ollama-driven** and **document-aware**. Before any model runs, the platform parses applicant uploads and assembles a complete application context — cover letter plus extracted document text. The model then produces structured output:

| Output | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| **Match score** | Overall fit percentage for the role |
| **Skills breakdown** | Matched, partial, and missing requirements |
| **Experience & education** | Evidence-based assessment against job criteria |
| **Summary** | Written narrative citing application content |
| **Recommendation** | Hire / maybe / no-hire aligned to evidence |

Analysis runs **per application**, not as a batch template. Rankings reflect genuine differentiation between candidates based on what they actually submitted.

